data: {"id": "8fdf4bd6fe1c48e8-thinking-parallel_evidence-3356", "run_id": "8fdf4bd6fe1c48e8", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "首轮五路采集已全部成功。以下基于真实工具结果梳理事实、冲突与缺口。\n\n## 1. 实体身份与生命周期\n| 维度 | 关键事实 |\n|---|---|\n| Pod YAML | `aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c`, UID `20db72b2-f223-4295-8f2d-62edd54cf1cd`, Node `node2`, 创建时间 2026-09-03T11:54:26Z, `restartPolicy: Always` |\n| 容器 | `app` 容器镜像 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`, 命令 `python3 /opt/aiops/server.py` |\n| Owner | `ReplicaSet/workload-7679bcf76` |\n| 当前阶段 | Pod `phase: Running`; 但条件 `Ready=False`, `ContainersReady=False`, 原因 `ContainersNotReady: contain", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788442469241, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

