data: {"id": "8fdf4bd6fe1c48e8-final", "run_id": "8fdf4bd6fe1c48e8", "seq": 3362, "ts_ms": 1788442503775, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c` | CrashLoopBackOff | {'container': 'app', 'reason': 'CrashLoopBackOff'} |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `reason: CrashLoopBackOff` | 确认容器 `app` 处于崩溃并正在被重试的状态 [fact-2084913c86d6] |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `message: Back-off restarting failed container app` | 描述 K8s 因容器异常退出而触发指数级退避重启机制 [fact-430f87e24889] |\n| 3 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `reason: Error`, `exit_code: 2` | 指出容器上次以 Error 原因终止，进程返回了具体的退出码 2 [fact-52c00fccf57b], [fact-5e412de6f32d] |\n| 4 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.status.restarts_total: 23` | 证实该容器在近期发生了 23 次重启，故障具有高发性 [fact-e93914761857] |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason = 1 (reason: CrashLoopBackOff)` | 独立确认了 K8s 状态的观察结果 [fact-0bc2d54e3b49] |\n| 6 | Logging | Elasticsearch | `pattern: {event: \"http_request\", level: \"error\", message: \"runtime process exiting\", http_status: 500, path: \"/work\"}` | 显示应用在处理 `/work` 请求时遭遇运行时错误并直接退出，伴随 HTTP 500 [fact-41d82ae5b969] |\n| 7 | Tracing | Tempo/Deepflow | `HTTP 200 GET /work` 正常 (6次) 与 `HTTP 500 GET /work` 失败 (3次) | 证明 `/work` 接口逻辑存在或曾存在可用状态，故障非网络不通，且失败请求集中在特定 trace 周期 [fact-3131e8fb9d07], [fact-41145b75929d] |\n\n**证据综合说明：**\nK8s 状态、Prometheus 指标与 Elasticsearch 日志高度一致，共同刻画了容器 `app` 因内部错误退出并导致 `CrashLoopBackOff` 的事实。日志中的 \"runtime process exiting\" 结合退出码 `2` 表明应用主动崩溃（如 Python 中 `sys.exit(2)`），而非被 K8s OOMKilled。Tracing 证明请求可达，故障发生在应用处理 `/work` 逻辑的内部。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n```text\n应用逻辑缺陷或运行环境异常 → /work 接口请求处理抛出未捕获的运行时异常 → 进程以退出码 2 终止并返回 HTTP 500 → Kubernetes 重启策略触发，容器进入 CrashLoopBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n**已确认的现象根因：** 应用容器 `app` 因内部未捕获的运行时错误（导致 `exitCode=2` 和 `HTTP 500`）而异常终止，触发了 K8s 的重启机制并进入 `CrashLoopBackOff`。\n\n**证据不足说明：**\n虽然已确认故障表象是“应用进程异常退出”，但无法确诊具体的**根本原因（Root Cause）**。依据配置要求及现有证据，以下决定性事实缺失：\n1.  **具体的异常类型与堆栈：** 日志仅记录了 \"runtime process exiting\"，未捕获导致退出的具体 Python 异常类（如 `KeyError`, `ConnectionRefusedError` 等）及完整的 Traceback。\n2.  **业务上下文缺失：** 缺少 `/work` 接口的具体业务逻辑及外部依赖状态数据，无法区分是代码缺陷、配置错误还是外部服务不可用导致的偶发错误。\n\n因缺少具体的异常堆栈和业务上下文，现有的日志与追踪数据不足以支撑对“导致该异常的深层原因”进行确诊。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 33.6s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 96.9s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c: 96.9s (Evidence 76.2s, RCA 20.5s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 13.7s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c**: pod-crashloop-runtime, pod-oomkilled\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 144.188, "metrics": {"run_id": "8fdf4bd6fe1c48e8", "mttr": {"value": "2.4m", "seconds": 144.19609713554382, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "45%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-oomkilled, pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 144196.09713554382, "llm_calls": 11, "llm_duration_ms": 139457.4954509735, "tool_calls": 13, "executed_tool_calls": 12, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 1, "successful_tool_calls": 12, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 12890.664100646973, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 4217.845439910889}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 33558.9280128479, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 96883.08143615723, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 13728.540182113647, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

